# One field from aa-counter-guard: a FIVE-unit party assaults remembered
# enemy extractors by attack-move. The v2 measure left the raid free and
# toothless at the first-wave size (3/12 vs 3/12, log 2026-07-30); this arm
# asks whether a party heavy enough to kill extractors through their cover
# converts free raiding into wins -- the size question, one field
# ([[policy-raid]]).

name aa-counter-guard-raid5
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 1
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 5
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 0
